{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01383",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 8.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "doctor, your next patient is here i've done the basics, I'll read them out in a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.01,
      "end_seconds": 16.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.04,
      "end_seconds": 23.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "doctor, it's a ring-shaped itchy patch. It's getting on my nerves now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.66,
      "end_seconds": 26.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.87,
      "end_seconds": 30.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "it's been six months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.28,
      "end_seconds": 41.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.22,
      "end_seconds": 49.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day yes, sweating that makes it worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.67,
      "end_seconds": 53.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.51,
      "end_seconds": 70.02,
      "duration_seconds": 15.51,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get scaly, peeling skin as well. There's darker skin around the patch as well. With darker skin around the patch, mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.03,
      "end_seconds": 76.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "did you get rash on the palms pain fever or new partner?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.76,
      "end_seconds": 81.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.61,
      "end_seconds": 90.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.55,
      "end_seconds": 94.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "no, uh, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.76,
      "end_seconds": 97.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.01,
      "end_seconds": 100.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.54,
      "end_seconds": 104.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.67,
      "end_seconds": 110.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I take metformin 500 milligrams twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 112.03,
      "end_seconds": 117.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 250 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.67,
      "end_seconds": 123.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "right do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.8,
      "end_seconds": 133.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "no, I left it it at home. Candid cream. I take it twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.28,
      "end_seconds": 136.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "So, and for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.68,
      "end_seconds": 144.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "For six months. I used to take Asthalin inhaler, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.12,
      "end_seconds": 160.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.41,
      "end_seconds": 165.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "No, um, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.47,
      "end_seconds": 172.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.4,
      "end_seconds": 178.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "I've got diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.98,
      "end_seconds": 183.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "ah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.29,
      "end_seconds": 185.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "yes, asthma"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.56,
      "end_seconds": 192.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.34,
      "end_seconds": 209.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "I think I reacted to to some antibiotic once years ago. I don't remember which one or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.69,
      "end_seconds": 226.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.94,
      "end_seconds": 240.17,
      "duration_seconds": 12.23,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. No, I share a house with my brother. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.27,
      "end_seconds": 245.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.03,
      "end_seconds": 252.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "My aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 254.04,
      "end_seconds": 263.68,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "here are the numbers, doctor oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse is 85 beats a minute, temperature is 36.6 degrees, pressure 121 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.38,
      "end_seconds": 265.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.12,
      "end_seconds": 270.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.33,
      "end_seconds": 273.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.58,
      "end_seconds": 293.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "There's a red ring-shaped scaly patch with a clearer centre in the the groin crease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.39,
      "end_seconds": 296.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "hold that that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.97,
      "end_seconds": 311.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "skin between the toes is white and peeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.9,
      "end_seconds": 317.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Thank you you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.05,
      "end_seconds": 346.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.51,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found I don't have a clear answer today: a fungal skin infection is possible and so is psoriasis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.34,
      "end_seconds": 351.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Oh I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.06,
      "end_seconds": 368.23,
      "duration_seconds": 15.17,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a fungal skin infection. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.0,
      "end_seconds": 371.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "yes, will do"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.61,
      "end_seconds": 380.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "For now, no new medicines or tests are needed. Alright, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.45,
      "end_seconds": 386.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Oh no that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}